# This folder deploys as the public "Restricted Area" placeholder, and its
# vercel.json sets outputDirectory "." — which means a deploy from here ships
# EVERY subfolder too. That is how kasi-guru-iota.vercel.app and
# admin-website-sandy.vercel.app both ended up serving a full, years-stale copy
# of the admin portal at /admin/js/app.js (1,235 lines against the current
# 3,326) to anyone who guessed the path.
#
# The portals are deployed from their own directories, as their own Vercel
# projects. Nothing here may carry them.
admin
download
